# Auto-strip Jupyter notebook outputs on commit so large cell outputs
# (images, dataframes, log dumps) never enter the repository.  Developers
# see full outputs locally; only the code cells are persisted.
#
# Requires nbstripout: pip install nbstripout
*.ipynb filter=nbstripout
*.ipynb diff=ipynb

# Pin LF for the generated apps-catalog fixture + its generator so the
# fixture-freshness check (gen-apps-catalog-fixture.mjs --check) is byte-stable
# across platforms — the generator always writes LF, so the committed file must
# stay LF or the --check drift gate would falsely fail on a CRLF checkout.
scripts/csa-loom/fixtures/apps-catalog.json text eol=lf
scripts/csa-loom/gen-apps-catalog-fixture.mjs text eol=lf

# B-N19b — the SDK contract artifacts are byte-compared by drift gates
# (`dump-openapi.mjs --check`, `generate_client.py --check`, the SHA-256
# tripwire in `csa_loom._generated.contract`, and the vitest snapshot pin).
# Both generators always write LF, and `gofmt` requires LF, so pin the whole
# sdk/ tree to LF or a CRLF checkout would falsely fail every one of them.
sdk/** text eol=lf

# #2603 — the ACR firewall lease + its regression test are executed by `bash` on
# Linux GitHub runners and are also invoked from the deploy-*-job.sh scripts. A
# CRLF checkout makes bash choke on the trailing \r ("$'\r': command not
# found"), so pin them to LF regardless of core.autocrlf.
scripts/csa-loom/acr-firewall-lease.sh text eol=lf
scripts/ci/test-acr-firewall-lease.sh text eol=lf

# #2836 — the sweeper's discovery half and its regression test, same reason:
# acr-firewall-sweeper.yml runs the first with `bash` on a Linux runner and
# loom-guardrails.yml runs the second.
scripts/csa-loom/acr-firewall-sweep-all.sh text eol=lf
scripts/ci/test-acr-firewall-sweep-all.sh text eol=lf

# PR #2640 — same reason for the image preflight and its self-test: both are run
# by `bash` in loom-guardrails.yml and in the Gov/Commercial deploy lanes, and a
# CRLF checkout would break them with "$'\r': command not found".
scripts/ci/assert-acr-image-tags.sh text eol=lf
scripts/ci/test-assert-acr-image-tags.sh text eol=lf
